  - `Levels.Default` equals Config.Waves numerically (hp/attack/armor/actionTurns/actionSeconds) for each wave.
  - `Levels.List.length === 6` and ids 1..6, each wave has ≥1 skill, every skill damage ≥ 0.
  - `Levels.get(999) === Levels.List[0]` fallback.
  - Level-scoped combat: `new Combat(new Board(), Levels.get(1))` → waveCount === 3 and enemy.maxHp === 36 (literal).
  - A level-3 elite combat: advanceWave ×2 → wave has 蓄力封锁 skill: first enemyAct = Prepare with 0 damage, second = Release with damage > attack and locked cells === 2.
